==German==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|goh|de}} {{term|mittil|lang=goh}}, akin to Old Saxon {{term|middil|lang=osx}}, compare Dutch {{term|middel|lang=nl}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|[ˈmɪtl̩]|[ˈmɪtəl]|lang=de}}
* {{audio|De-Mittel.ogg|audio}}

===Noun===
{{de-noun|g=n|genitive=Mittels|pl=Mittel}}

# [[agent]], [[appliance]]
# [[means]]
